***NOTIFICATION TYPES REFERENCE

Supported notification types for filtering:

# Group Management (6 types)
- GROUP_INVITATION           # User invited to join group
- GROUP_INVITATION_ACCEPTED  # Someone accepted invitation
- GROUP_ROLE_CHANGED         # User's role changed (ADMIN/MEMBER)
- GROUP_MEMBER_ADDED         # New member joined
- GROUP_MEMBER_REMOVED       # Member was removed
- GROUP_MEMBER_LEFT          # Member left voluntarily

# Chat Notifications (2 types)
- GROUP_CHAT_MENTION         # @mentioned in group chat
- GROUP_CHAT_NEW_MESSAGE     # Unread messages notification

# Bill Notifications (6 types) - ✅ 3 IMPLEMENTED
- BILL_CREATED               # ✅ New bill assigned to group
- BILL_UPDATED               # ✅ Bill details changed
- BILL_DELETED               # ✅ Bill removed from group
- BILL_PAYMENT_REQUIRED      # ⚠️ Payment due (not yet wired)
- BILL_PAYMENT_RECEIVED      # ⚠️ Payment received (not yet wired)
- BILL_SPLIT_UPDATED         # ⚠️ Split ratios changed (not yet implemented)

# Contribution Notifications (2 types) - ⚠️ PENDING
- CONTRIBUTION_ADDED         # Someone added contribution
- CONTRIBUTION_REMINDER      # Reminder to contribute

# System Notifications (2 types) - ⚠️ PARTIAL
- SYSTEM_ANNOUNCEMENT        # Admin announcement
- ACCOUNT_UPDATE             # Account-related update

***NOTIFICATION BEHAVIOR NOTES

# Automatic Notifications (No manual trigger needed):
- BILL_CREATED: Triggered automatically when POST /groupbill/{groupId}/bills succeeds
- BILL_UPDATED: Triggered automatically when PUT /bill/{bill_id} succeeds
- BILL_DELETED: Triggered automatically when DELETE /bill/{bill_id} succeeds
- GROUP_CHAT_MENTION: Triggered automatically when message contains @username
- GROUP_INVITATION: Triggered when POST /groups/{user_id}/{group_id}/invitations
- GROUP_INVITATION_ACCEPTED: Triggered when PUT /invitations/{id}/invitationStatus with "Accepted"
- GROUP_MEMBER_ADDED: Triggered when user added to group
- GROUP_ROLE_CHANGED: Triggered when PUT /groups/{groupId}/members/{userId}/role
- GROUP_MEMBER_REMOVED: Triggered when DELETE /groups/{groupId}/members/{userId}
- GROUP_MEMBER_LEFT: Triggered when PUT /groups/{groupId}/members/{userId}/leave

# Manual Notification Triggers:
- GROUP_CHAT_NEW_MESSAGE: Call POST /messages/conversation/{conversationId}/notify-unread

# Real-time Delivery:
All notifications are sent via WebSocket immediately after creation:
ws://localhost:8080/NotificationServer/{userId}

# Priority Levels:
- High (3): Invitations, mentions, payment required
- Medium (2): Bill updates, role changes
- Low (1): Member activities, bill deletions

***QUICK JOIN BY CODE (Temporary Groups)

# Create temporary group with auto-generated join code
POST http://localhost:8080/groups
Content-Type: application/json

Request body - set "isTemporary": true to auto-generate a 5-character join code:
{
  "group_name": "Table 5 - Dec 10",
  "capacity": 4,
  "isTemporary": true
}

Expected Response:
{
  "group_id": 87,
  "group_name": "Table 5 - Dec 10",
  "capacity": 4,
  "joinCode": "95TZA",           ← Auto-generated 5-character code (A-Z, 0-9)
  "isTemporary": true,
  "createdDate": "2024-12-10T15:30:00"
}

Optional: You can provide your own custom join code:
{
  "group_name": "VIP Table",
  "capacity": 6,
  "isTemporary": true,
  "joinCode": "CUSTOM"           ← Must be exactly 5 characters, unique
}

# Join group by code (no invitation needed)
POST http://localhost:8080/groups/join/{code}?userId={userId}

Example: POST http://localhost:8080/groups/join/95TZA?userId=30

Expected Response:
{
  "message": "User successfully joined the group",
  "group": {
    "group_id": 87,
    "group_name": "Table 5 - Dec 10",
    "joinCode": "95TZA",
    "isTemporary": true
  },
  "userGroup": {
    "id": 145,
    "userId": 30,
    "groupId": 87,
    "role": "MEMBER"
  }
}

# Get group info by code (verify code before joining)
GET http://localhost:8080/groups/code/{code}

Example: GET http://localhost:8080/groups/code/95TZA

Expected Response:
{
  "group_id": 87,
  "group_name": "Table 5 - Dec 10",
  "capacity": 4,
  "joinCode": "95TZA",
  "isTemporary": true,
  "currentMembers": 3
}

